Constraints

e The project team is geographically removed. This may impact on communication and the ability to

meet.

e There appears to be a lack of dedicated resource in MEC.

e Political conflict and instability in some of the markets.

e Lack of basic infrastructure in some markets — e.g. quality of telephone and internet connections etc.

e Personal risk of service providers and other personnel.

e Law enforcement is low in many countries that we face high levels of illicit trade.

Benefits

The overall project benefit is to create the opportunity to sell 1.5 Billion extra sticks, attributable to the AIT

project.

3.7.1 Cost Savings

e The project is approached as a growth project and therefore has to be evaluated based on

the benefits it delivers.

